<title>UK: TENNIS-INTERNATIONAL OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INTERNATIONAL OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOURNEMOUTH, England 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at</p>
<p>the Bournemouth International Open men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Alberto Costa (Spain) beat Michael Geserer (Germany) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Albert Portas (Spain) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>8-Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat Thierry Champion (France)</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6) 6-2</p>
<p>7-Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 0-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>5-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>3-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Roldolphe Gilbert (France)</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
